WEBVTT

00:00.700 --> 00:05.100
This is BrightTech Solutions,
in East Legon, Accra.

00:05.850 --> 00:11.200
We sell the computers, printers and
power backup your business runs on.

00:11.930 --> 00:17.500
We set them up: the software, the Wi-Fi,
the cabling and the cameras.

00:18.230 --> 00:23.650
And when something stops working, we pick up
the phone, and we come and fix it.

00:24.380 --> 00:31.400
BrightTech Solutions. Computers that work.
Networks that stay up.
